{"status":"completed","summary":"Inventory web tier completed. node2 and node3 serve the application on port 8080; node1 load-balances port 80 across both using HAProxy round-robin health checks. All nodes passed sequential reboot and recovery verification.","actions_performed":["Created persistent inventory.service instances on node2 and node3 using the installed Python 3 runtime.","Configured inventory HTML, JSON API, health endpoint, and backend-identification headers.","Installed HAProxy 3.0.5 from the native CentOS repository on node1 and configured both backends with HTTP health checks.","Persistently opened HTTP/80 on node1 and TCP/8080 on both backends.","Verified remote requests alternate node2, node3, node2, node3.","Rebooted node1, node2, and node3 individually and verified changed boot identities and service/data recovery after each."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Preserve the installed operating-system release and kernel","command_ids":["cmd-fe90793772f94ca9","cmd-3b85a2d699e64315","cmd-b0469c9135134366","cmd-b0ada6b862494ed7"],"summary":"All nodes began on CentOS Stream 10 with kernel 6.12.0-205.el10.x86_64; final verification still reports that kernel."},{"requirement":"Run the inventory application on node2 port 8080","command_ids":["cmd-90333e6594594db3","cmd-32971f14a9c14dce","cmd-1958f258381548eb"],"summary":"inventory.service is enabled and active, listens on 0.0.0.0:8080, and returns node2 inventory data before and after reboot."},{"requirement":"Run the inventory application on node3 port 8080","command_ids":["cmd-4ba3355b66ad4f56","cmd-c6d66b19ac984078","cmd-6f692b6189d24cf7"],"summary":"inventory.service is enabled and active, listens on 0.0.0.0:8080, and returns node3 inventory data before and after reboot."},{"requirement":"Load-balance node1 port 80 across both backends","command_ids":["cmd-67b8fc9bf2cc4a78","cmd-5ffdcb62131843ed","cmd-b0ada6b862494ed7","cmd-8dc32f6622ec4c62"],"summary":"HAProxy is enabled and active on 0.0.0.0:80. Local and remote request traces return HTTP 200 and alternate node2/node3; the inventory HTML and all items remain available."},{"requirement":"Mandatory node1 restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-d84d10f86d67486b","cmd-1fb901bfd0544d3e"],"summary":"Healthy baseline and reboot acknowledgement were captured. Boot ID changed from 21de1f79-e793-4c36-923a-f4af0bbea55e to 36637893-2f8c-40f9-9bb8-0ffa57b6c168; HAProxy recovered and served both backends."},{"requirement":"Mandatory node2 restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-ceb9df10ab1f4636","cmd-1958f258381548eb","cmd-ab3cd1b8df534a28"],"summary":"Healthy baseline and reboot acknowledgement were captured. Boot ID changed from 83a0a80f-773c-4f3e-9137-1e7aa887b07a to a548a779-683c-4d0f-ae76-70ff6ce2ac77; inventory data recovered and node2 rejoined load-balancer rotation."},{"requirement":"Mandatory node3 restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-ab8bea45be2a486f","cmd-6f692b6189d24cf7","cmd-b0ada6b862494ed7"],"summary":"Healthy baseline and reboot acknowledgement were captured. Boot ID changed from 5e93a57c-0d8d-454e-8fb1-617b2a46810c to 44f40541-add5-4dea-ad1e-04b1c8b56ee4; inventory data recovered and node3 rejoined load-balancer rotation."}]}
